{
  "title": "Hearty Indulgent Saudi Arabian Pork Back Ribs Kebabs",
  "description": "Tangy and tender pork back ribs kebabs with a Saudi Arabian twist, served with toast for a satisfying meal, this dish is made with low calorie friendly ingredients to make it a guilt free indulgence",
