  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the pork back ribs to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade",
    "Thread the marinated pork back ribs onto skewers",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper",
    "Bake the kebabs for 25 minutes, or until cooked through",
    "While the kebabs are cooking, toast the whole wheat bread",
    "Serve the kebabs with the toasted bread",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired"
